 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 518210,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The amount of $13,000 is invested in a savings account. After 10 years the account has $15,250.00. Find the return on investment for this account.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The return on investment (ROI) is the percent difference between the initial investment (<i>P</i>) and the final value of the investment (<i>FV</i>), or <span data-math=\"{\\rm{ROI}} = \\frac{{FV - P}}{P}\"></span>, expressed as a percentage. The length of time of the investment is not considered in ROI.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\rm{ROI}} = \\frac{{FV - P}}{P} = \\frac{{15,250 - 13,000}}{{13,000}} = \\frac{{2,250}}{{13,000}} \\approx 0.17307.... \\approx 17.31\\%\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "17.31%"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 518211,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The amount of $6,500 is deposited in a money market account. After 7 years, the account has $7,358.00. Find the return on investment for this account.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The return on investment (ROI) is the percent difference between the initial investment (<i>P</i>) and the final value of the investment (<i>FV</i>), or <span data-math=\"{\\rm{ROI}} = \\frac{{FV - P}}{P}\"></span>, expressed as a percentage. The length of time of the investment is not considered in ROI.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\rm{ROI}} = \\frac{{FV - P}}{P} = \\frac{{7,358 - 6,500}}{{6,500}} = \\frac{{858}}{{6,500}} = 0.132 = 13.2\\%\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "13.2%"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
